# PC card pc-melee-near pilot (BENCH-177, Leigh's card rule of 2026-11-03): n4 against an aa baseline battle for battle on the 46 census fields x 2 seeds (3277-3278, after the card's 3271-3276), 184 battles, about 17% of the card. tools/melee_pilot.py stops the card unless Hadur's score share is up and its crowd deaths down. Template: mnprep writes work/melee-near-pilot.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @C@ = the machine's melee width.
--suite
melee-census-317.txt
--seeds
2
--seed-base
3276
--rounds
35
--parallel
@C@
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.Hadur_@V@n4.jar
--robot
hadur117.Hadur @V@n4
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.Hadur_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.Hadur @V@aa
--out
